 "The crown block reached a {0} m width with sliding {1} and overturning {2}. Lower the parapet, widen the armour berm in front of it or key the base into the core.": "胸墙宽度已达 {0} m，抗滑 {1}，抗倾覆 {2}。应降低胸墙顶、加宽墙前护面平台，或将底板嵌入堤心。",
 "The drawdown case governs: the wall is sized by the saturated backfill pushing it seaward at the trough, so the backfill grading and the drainage detail set the base width more than the design wave does.": "波谷工况控制设计：波谷时饱和填土将墙体推向海侧，因此底板宽度主要取决于填土级配和排水构造，而非设计波浪。",
 "The existing bed at {0} m CD is already below the dredge level {1} m CD. No capital dredging is needed for depth.": "现状河床 {0} m CD 已低于疏浚高程 {1} m CD，无需为满足水深进行基建疏浚。",
 "The fill is coarser than the native sand, so it stands steeper and meets the native profile {0} m offshore, at {1} m depth. Every cubic metre works on the visible beach.": "填沙粗于原砂，剖面更陡，在离岸 {0} m、水深 {1} m 处与原剖面相交。每立方米填沙都作用于可见海滩。",
 "The fill is finer than the native sand, so it lies flatter and never meets the native profile: the placement runs all the way to closure, and part of it does nothing for the dry beach.": "填沙细于原砂，剖面更缓，与原剖面不相交：填沙一直延伸至闭合深度，其中一部分对干滩毫无贡献。",
 "The literature is quoted in English.": "文献内容以英文原文引用。",
 "The stream function wave did not converge, which puts this wave at breaking. Linear theory with Wheeler stretching is used instead and understates the crest kinematics.": "流函数波不收敛，说明该波浪已达破碎。改用带 Wheeler 拉伸的线性理论，会低估波峰处的水质点运动。",
 "The wall retains {0} m. A cantilever L-wall is ordinary practice up to about {1} m; beyond that a counterforted wall, a caisson or an anchored sheet-pile wall is the usual form, and the stem here ({2} m) shows why.": "挡墙挡土高度 {0} m。悬臂式 L 形墙通常适用于约 {1} m 以内；超过此高度一般采用扶壁式挡墙、沉箱或锚定板桩墙，本例墙身厚度（{2} m）即说明了原因。",
 "The worst moment is {0}% larger than the moment at the crest phase. Designing on the crest alone would have understated it.": "最不利弯矩比波峰相位弯矩大 {0}%。仅按波峰设计会低估该值。",
 "The {0} m toe berm sits close to the wall, where the standing wave moves the bed least, which is why Tanimoto allows {1} t stone. The scour hole forms about a quarter wavelength out, {2} m from the face; widen the berm to reach it if the toe is also the scour protection, and the stone will grow.": "{0} m 宽的护脚棱体紧靠墙体，该处立波对床面的扰动最小，因此 Tanimoto 公式允许采用 {1} t 块石。冲刷坑出现在约四分之一波长处，距墙面 {2} m；若护脚同时兼作防冲措施，应加宽棱体以覆盖该处，块石重量随之增大。",
